<section class="sec sec--deep" id="standards">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our public standards</p>
    <h2>The rules we hold ourselves to</h2>
    <p class="lede">We work with sick people, grieving families, and communities that have already been lied to. These are public so you can hold us to them.</p>
    <ol class="std">
      <li><div><strong>We will never cold call you.</strong><p class="muted">We do not buy lead lists and we do not knock on doors. If someone calls claiming to be us and you did not reach out first, it is not us. Report it.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>We will never solicit a terminally ill person directly.</strong><p class="muted">We work through the family member who contacted us, or through their clinician. Never the patient cold.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>We will always tell you the free option exists.</strong><p class="muted">RESEP clinics assist at no cost. Many people file with no company and no attorney. You will hear this from us on the first call.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>We will never tell you that you qualify.</strong><p class="muted">Only the Department of Justice decides that. Anyone who says you are approved or pre-qualified is not telling you the truth.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>You pay nothing unless the claim is paid.</strong><p class="muted">No retainer, no fees of any kind up front. Our fee is contingent and it is in writing before you sign.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>We will give you a fast no.</strong><p class="muted">A quick honest no is worth more to you than a slow maybe.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>We are not the government and we are not lawyers.</strong><p class="muted">Independent and privately owned. Our claim guides do not give legal advice. When a matter needs an attorney we say so, and you may choose your own.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Your records are yours.</strong><p class="muted">We tell you what we collect and why. Request deletion at any time. We never sell or share your information outside your claim.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Your story is yours.</strong><p class="muted">If we film you, the release is revocable at any time for any reason and we take it down within 24 hours. We film families whether or not they become clients.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>No countdowns, no fear, no pressure.</strong><p class="muted">The deadline is real and we will state it plainly. We will not use timers or scarcity tactics.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>A real person, with a name and a number.</strong><p class="muted">You will always know who you are talking to. Not a form.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="legal">If we ever break one of these, tell us, and tell your state consumer protection division. We mean that.</p>
